  "title": "We raised $10.5M",
  "summary": "Interactive video is the future. We raised over $10M seed round to build it. Our interactive video model - Lemon Slice 2 - just launched: real-time talking avatars that stream at 20fps on a single GPU from one photo. Talk to avatars now: lemonslice.com (no signup) Or integrate into your product using our API. ElevenLabs gave AI a voice. We're giving it a face. Grateful to Y Combinator, Matrix, Mantis Venture Capital, Emmett Shear (Twitch Co-founder/CEO), Arash Ferdowsi (Dropbox Co-founder/CT",
